// Windows Recall Feature Enabled - Registry | T1113 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_enable_windows_recall.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where ends_with(registry.path, "\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\WindowsAI\\DisableAIDataAnalysis") and winlog.event_data.Details=="DWORD (0x00000000)"
